on":"How long does a typical AI project take?","answer":"Most focused automation and AI assistant projects go from discovery to production in 3 to 6 weeks. Larger custom model deployments typically take 6 to 10 weeks with weekly milestones."},{"question":"Do we need a large technical team to work with you?","answer":"Not at all. We handle architecture, development, integration, and deployment end-to-end, and train your team so anyone can operate the system confidently."},{"question":"How do you keep our company data secure and private?","answer":"Your data never trains public models. We deploy within private cloud environments or enterprise APIs with strict encryption, role-based access, and audit logging."},{"question":"Can you integrate with the tools we already use?","answer":"Yes — we integrate natively with Slack, HubSpot, Salesforce, Notion, Linear, Zendesk, Postgres, and custom internal APIs."},{"question":"What happens after our AI solution is launched?","answer":"We provide ongoing monitoring, performance tuning, and support packages to ensure your workflows continue delivering measurable ROI as your business grows."}],"allowMultipleOpen":false,"emitSchemaOrg":true},"style":{"maxWidth":{"desktop":"760px"},"margin":{"desktop":{"right":"auto","left":"auto"}}}}]}]}]}]}